    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Aviator is an adventure play structure shaped like an aeroplane, made almost entirely of rope net. Children climb through the fuselage and wings, and two purple slides bring them down at the front. From above, the frame reads clearly as an aircraft. It comes in Lemon Green. Aviator takes 40 to 45 children, covers 36'8\" x 30'6\", and needs a safe play area of 42'8\" x 36'6\", so it suits large parks, resorts and school grounds. Net climbing builds strength and confidence, and the listed skills also include leadership and self control. It is part of the Escapade series in our NexLev range. We give a 3-year warranty on its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us for a quote."
     }
    ]
   }
